                </td>
                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>Drug clinical research has become a vital part of modern medicine. As a bridge between medical practice and drug development, clinical investigators must build on solid medical knowledge and master both the theory and practice of clinical research. This course covers the full process of clinical research, introducing core concepts, study design principles, and implementation standards. Combined with practical training, it helps students develop a systematic understanding and prepares them to engage in clinical research at an early stage. The goal is to cultivate well-rounded professionals with both medical insight and research capabilities.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
